# Feature: Sentry ciutatis-admin

## Scope

End-to-end Sentry for the Ciutatis admin control plane:

| Surface | SDK | Project |
|---------|-----|---------|
| Express API (`server/`, :3100) | `@sentry/node` | `ciutatis-admin` |
| Admin browser (`admin.ciutatis.com`) | `@sentry/nextjs` client | `ciutatis-admin` via `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ADMIN_DSN` |
| Public site (`ciutatis.com`) | `@sentry/nextjs` | `ciutatis-public` (unchanged) |

## Server wiring

1. `server/src/instrument.ts` — `Sentry.init` with admin DSN
2. First import in `server/src/index.ts` + `--import` on `dev`/`start` scripts
3. `Sentry.setupExpressErrorHandler(app)` before `errorHandler`
4. `errorHandler` captures 500s via `Sentry.captureException`
5. `Sentry.flush` on shutdown
6. Opt-in `GET /api/debug-sentry` when `SENTRY_DEBUG_ROUTE=1`

## Verification

```sh
# Start API with verify route enabled
SENTRY_DEBUG_ROUTE=1 pnpm --filter @paperclipai/server dev
curl -i http://localhost:3100/api/debug-sentry
```

Then confirm the event appears in Sentry project `ciutatis-admin`.
